<title>USA: Ultrafit Centers opens Arizona franchise.</title>
<headline>Ultrafit Centers opens Arizona franchise.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrafit Centers Inc said on Monday its first franchise would open in Sun City West, Arizona on October 1.</p>
<p>The company specializes in preventive health care by combining medical clinics with exercise and nutrition programs.</p>
</text>
